---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Resources for Iowa Educators Supporting Military Children
description: Find Purple Star School guidance, Month of the Military Child classroom kits, and resources for Iowa educators supporting military-connected students.
permalink: /educators/index.html
mainClass: educators-page
---
{% macro cardHeading(title, icon, number, eyebrow) %}
  <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
    <span class="grid h-10 w-10 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-slate-100 text-primary">
      <svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
        <path d="{{ icon }}"/>
      </svg>
    </span>
    <span class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-600">
      {% if number %}Requirement <span class="ml-1 tabular-nums">{{ number }}</span>{% else %}{{ eyebrow }}{% endif %}
    </span>
  </div>
  <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold leading-tight text-slate-900">{{ title }}</h2>
{% endmacro %}

{% macro resourceLink(url, label, thumbnail) %}
  <a class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-3 rounded-sm py-2 font-semibold text-primary underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-slate-900 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary" href="{{ url | escape }}">
    {% if thumbnail %}
      <img src="{{ thumbnail }}" alt="" width="40" height="40" class="h-10 w-10 shrink-0 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white object-contain" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
    {% endif %}
    <span>{{ label }}</span>
  </a>
{% endmacro %}

{% macro cardPhoto(src, alt) %}
  <img src="{{ src }}" alt="{{ alt }}" class="aspect-[2/1] w-full rounded-xl object-cover" {{ imageAttrs(src) }} loading="lazy" decoding="async">
{% endmacro %}

{% set guardResourceUrl = "https://www.iowanationalguard.com/wfsb/purplestar.html" %}
{% set cardClass = "flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-zinc-50 px-5 pb-2 pt-5" %}
{% set summaryClass = "min-h-11 cursor-pointer rounded-sm py-3 font-semibold text-primary hover:underline focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary" %}

<div class="container space-y-4 py-8 sm:py-12">
  <section class="relative isolate flex min-h-[23rem] items-center overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950 sm:min-h-[28rem]">
    <img src="/assets/img/programs/momc_purple_up.jpg" alt="Children and families applaud at the Iowa Capitol during the Month of the Military Child proclamation" class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover object-center" {{ imageAttrs('/assets/img/programs/momc_purple_up.jpg') }} fetchpriority="high" decoding="async">
    <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_28%_50%,rgba(2,6,23,0.74)_0%,rgba(2,6,23,0.60)_32%,rgba(2,6,23,0.08)_88%)]" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="relative space-y-4 px-5 py-10 text-white sm:px-10">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-widest text-white">IOWA CYP · FOR SCHOOLS &amp; EDUCATORS</p>
      <h1 class="max-w-2xl text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight text-white sm:text-4xl">Becoming a Purple Star School may be easier than you think.</h1>
      <p class="max-w-xl leading-relaxed text-white">Many schools are already doing much of what Purple Star recognition asks for. Start with what you have, use the ideas below to fill the gaps, and reach out to Iowa CYP when you need help.</p>
      <ul class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2" role="list">
        <li><a href="#requirements" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-full border border-white/30 bg-slate-950/70 px-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white underline underline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-white">See the four requirements</a></li>
        {% for label in ["Simple first steps", "We're here to help"] %}
          <li class="rounded-full border border-white/30 bg-slate-950/70 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-medium text-white">{{ label }}</li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div id="requirements" tabindex="-1" role="group" aria-label="Four Purple Star requirements" class="grid scroll-mt-28 gap-4 leading-relaxed text-slate-700 md:grid-cols-2">
    <article class="{{ cardClass }}">
      {{ cardHeading("Choose a School Liaison", "m12 3 2.8 5.7 6.2.9-4.5 4.4 1.1 6.2-5.6-3-5.6 3 1.1-6.2L3 9.6l6.2-.9L12 3Z", "01") }}
      <p>A counselor, teacher, or administrator who already supports families can be your school’s liaison.</p>
      <p class="text-slate-900"><strong>First step:</strong> Choose a point of contact.</p>
      <details class="mt-auto">
        <summary class="{{ summaryClass }}">Review Iowa’s designation guidance</summary>
        <div class="space-y-3 border-t border-slate-200 pt-3">
          {{ resourceLink("https://educate.iowa.gov/pk-12/award-exchange-programs/purple-star-school-program", "Iowa Department of Education guidance") }}
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Iowa CYP suggestions for preparing</h3>
          <p class="pb-2">Start with a liaison and a small planning team. Review what your school already offers, decide where to list the military family resource link, and pick an awareness activity and staff training topic. Keep examples of this work on hand when you apply.</p>
        </div>
      </details>
    </article>

    <article class="{{ cardClass }}">
      {{ cardHeading("Link to Family Resources", "M4 4h16a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v14a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V5a1 1 0 0 1 1-1Zm-1 5h18m-14 4h4m-4 3h9", "02") }}
      <p>Use the Iowa National Guard’s ready-made resource page for military families.</p>
      <p class="text-slate-900"><strong>First step:</strong> <a href="{{ guardResourceUrl }}" class="rounded-sm font-semibold text-primary underline underline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary">Add the link</a> to your school website.</p>
      <details class="mt-auto">
        <summary class="{{ summaryClass }}">Copy the link and label</summary>
        <div class="space-y-3 border-t border-slate-200 pt-3">
          <p>On your school website, open your existing Families or Enrollment section and add a link using these details.</p>
          <dl class="space-y-2 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-3">
            <div><dt class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Link label</dt><dd>Military Student and Family Resources</dd></div>
            <div><dt class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Link address</dt><dd class="break-all">{{ resourceLink(guardResourceUrl, guardResourceUrl) }}</dd></div>
          </dl>
          <p>Example placement: Families → Enrollment Resources → Military Student and Family Resources. You can list your school liaison’s contact information beside the link.</p>
        </div>
      </details>
    </article>

    <article class="{{ cardClass }}">
      {{ cardHeading("Celebrate Military Kids", "M3 5h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v11a5 5 0 0 0-4-2H3V5Zm18 0h-5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v11a5 5 0 0 1 4-2h5V5Z", "03") }}
      <p>Recognize military-connected students with Purple Up Day or an activity your school already hosts.</p>
      <p class="text-slate-900"><strong>First step:</strong> Choose an activity that fits your school.</p>
      <details class="mt-auto">
        <summary class="{{ summaryClass }}">See easy activity ideas</summary>
        <div class="space-y-3 border-t border-slate-200 pt-3">
          {{ resourceLink("/month-of-the-military-child/", "Explore classroom kits and April activities") }}
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Flyers and classroom resources</h3>
          <p>Host a Purple Up day, make a hallway display, or invite military families to share their experiences if they choose.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>{{ resourceLink("/assets/files/momc_flyer.png", "Ways to Participate flyer") }}</li>
            <li>{{ resourceLink("/assets/files/purpleup.jpg", "Purple Up profile graphic") }}</li>
            <li>{{ resourceLink("/assets/files/momc_overview.png", "Month of the Military Child overview flyer") }}</li>
            <li>{{ resourceLink("/lemonade-boss/", "Lemonade Boss youth entrepreneurship curriculum", "/assets/img/lemonade-banner.jpg") }}</li>
            <li>{{ resourceLink("mailto:iaarngcyp@gmail.com?subject=Purple%20Up%20Highlights", "Email your Purple Up highlights") }}</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </details>
    </article>

    <article class="{{ cardClass }}">
      {{ cardHeading("Help Your Staff Feel Prepared", "M3 8l9-5 9 5-9 5-9-5Zm4 2.2V16c3 2 7 2 10 0v-5.8M21 8v7", "04") }}
      <p>Build on staff training with practical ways to support military-connected students.</p>
      <p class="text-slate-900"><strong>First step:</strong> Choose a training opportunity.</p>
      <details class="mt-auto">
        <summary class="{{ summaryClass }}">Explore training options</summary>
        <div class="space-y-3 border-t border-slate-200 pt-3">
          {{ resourceLink("https://militarychild.org/for-education-professionals/training/", "Military Child Education Coalition training for educators") }}
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Topics for staff development</h3>
          <ul class="list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
            <li>How military life can shape a student’s experience at school.</li>
            <li>How to support midyear enrollment, records transfers, course placement, and belonging.</li>
            <li>When to connect families with the school liaison and local support services.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </details>
    </article>

  </div>

  <section class="relative isolate flex min-h-44 items-center overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950 sm:min-h-52">
    <img src="/assets/img/resources/classroom-activity-generated.jpg" alt="Teacher and students building a model together at a classroom table" class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover object-[65%_46%]" width="1774" height="887" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
    <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_22%_50%,rgba(2,6,23,0.84)_0%,rgba(2,6,23,0.69)_38%,rgba(2,6,23,0.12)_90%)]" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="relative px-5 py-6 text-white sm:px-10 sm:py-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white sm:text-3xl">That’s the foundation.</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 max-w-lg leading-relaxed">Purple Star recognition centers on these four areas. Iowa CYP can help you find resources, examples, and connections to put them into practice.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div role="group" aria-label="Iowa CYP support" class="grid gap-4 leading-relaxed text-slate-700 md:grid-cols-2">
    <article class="{{ cardClass }}">
      {{ cardHeading("Find Ready-to-Use Resources", "M20.8 8.7c0 4-4.5 7.3-8.8 11.3C7.7 16 3.2 12.7 3.2 8.7A4.5 4.5 0 0 1 12 7.4a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 8.8 1.3Z", "", "Tools & Resources") }}
      <p>Find classroom activities, training, and trusted resources for military families.</p>
      <details class="mt-auto">
        <summary class="{{ summaryClass }}">Explore resources</summary>
        <div class="space-y-3 border-t border-slate-200 pt-3">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
            {{ cardPhoto("/content/Media/ball2.jpg", "Families dancing together at the Military Family Ball") }}
            {{ cardPhoto("/assets/img/programs/family_ball_dance.jpg", "Guard families on the dance floor at the Military Family Ball") }}
          </div>
          <ul>
            <li>{{ resourceLink("/military-families/", "Iowa military family programs and support contacts") }}</li>
            <li>{{ resourceLink("/resources/", "Iowa CYP family resource directory") }}</li>
          </ul>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">School transitions, tutoring, and enrichment</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>{{ resourceLink("https://mic3.net/state/iowa/", "Iowa Interstate Compact on Educational Opportunity for Military Children") }}</li>
            <li>{{ resourceLink("https://military.tutor.com/home", "Tutor.com for military families", "/content/Media/tutor-square-color.png") }}</li>
            <li>{{ resourceLink("https://www.bgca.org/about-us/military/mission-youth-outreach-2025/", "Boys & Girls Clubs Mission Youth Outreach", "/assets/img/partners/partner_bgca.png") }}</li>
            <li>{{ resourceLink(site.links.scholarshipDatabase, "Scholarship database for military-connected students", "/assets/img/resources/resource_scholarships.svg") }}</li>
            <li>{{ resourceLink("https://search.militaryscholar.org/", "Search national scholarships for military families") }}</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </details>
    </article>

    <article class="{{ cardClass }}">
      {{ cardHeading("Talk With Iowa CYP", "M5 5h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v10a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V7a2 2 0 0 1 2-2Zm-2 2 9 6 9-6", "", "How we can help") }}
      <p>Get help with resource links, school activities, or support for a military family.</p>
      <div class="mt-auto">
        {{ resourceLink("/contact/#general-contact", "Contact Iowa CYP") }}
        <details>
          <summary class="{{ summaryClass }}">Meet the team</summary>
          <div class="space-y-3 border-t border-slate-200 pt-3">
            <ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-5" role="list">
              {% for member in team.members %}
                <li class="space-y-2">
                  <img src="{{ member.headshot }}" alt="" width="96" height="96" class="h-24 w-24 rounded-xl object-cover" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
                  <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900">{{ member.name }}</p>
                </li>
              {% endfor %}
            </ul>
            <ul>
              <li>{{ resourceLink("mailto:" + site.contactEmail, "Email Iowa CYP") }}</li>
              <li>{{ resourceLink("tel:" + (site.contactPhone | replace("-", "")), "Call Iowa CYP at " + site.contactPhone) }}</li>
            </ul>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Other ways Iowa CYP can help</h3>
            <p>We can share talking points and connect you with Soldier and Family Readiness Support Specialists or designated peer schools.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
  <section class="space-y-3 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-stone-50 p-5 text-slate-700 sm:p-7">
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary">Already doing some of this?</p>
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl">Great. Don’t start over.</h2>
    <p class="max-w-3xl">Your school may already have people, resources, training, or activities that support military-connected students. Start by identifying what you already have. Then use this guide to fill any gaps.</p>
    <a class="btn" href="https://engage.iowa.gov/jfe/form/SV_3VmTKziM34hrPKu">View the official application</a>
    <details>
      <summary class="{{ summaryClass }} text-sm">See what counts</summary>
      <div class="space-y-3 border-t border-slate-200 pt-3">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Official Iowa designation checklist</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
          <li>Name a staff member as the military liaison for students and families.</li>
          <li>Maintain a dedicated webpage with resources tailored to military-connected families. Include a link to the {{ resourceLink(guardResourceUrl, "Iowa National Guard’s student and family resource page") }}.</li>
          <li>Run programs or events that build awareness and support military-connected students.</li>
          <li>Offer staff training on the challenges these students face.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-3">Designation lasts three years. Check the state guidance for application dates, sample questions, and renewal information.</p>
        {{ resourceLink("mailto:purple.star@iowa.gov", "Email the state designation team") }}
      </div>
    </details>
  </section>

</div>
